{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51712","headline":"酒令（涓与王司空锴等小酌，巡故字令。锴举一字三呼，两物相似。锴令曰：） 一 · 冯涓","name":"酒令（涓与王司空锴等小酌，巡故字令。锴举一字三呼，两物相似。锴令曰：） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐乐乐，冷淘似餺飥。\n（涓曰云云，合座大咍，涓独不笑，但仰视长啸而已。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯涓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}